tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>Upgradeable - Secondary Augment:</b> This item can be upgraded to contain a Green, Orange (weapons and shields only) or Purple (weapons and shields only) augment. Bring this item to the <a href=\"/page/Fountain_of_Necrotic_Might\" title=\"Fountain of Necrotic Might\">Fountain of Necrotic Might</a> outside the Black Mausoleum and combine it with <a href=\"/page/Item:Masterwork_Tapestry_Shred\" title=\"Item:Masterwork Tapestry Shred\">Item:Masterwork Tapestry Shreds</a> to upgrade the item.</span></span> (<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon augment green\"><span class=\"title\"><a href=\"/page/Augment_Slot\" title=\"Augment Slot\">Green Augment Slot</a></span><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Blue_augments\" title=\"Category:Blue augments\">Blue</a>, <a href=\"/page/Category:Green_augments\" title=\"Category:Green augments\">Green</a>, <a href=\"/page/Category:Yellow_augments\" title=\"Category:Yellow augments\">Yellow</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Category:Colorless_augments\" title=\"Category:Colorless augments\">Colorless</a></span></span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Belt Boost</a> +1 or +3<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Belt Boost</a> +1 or +3:</b> +1 or +3 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Melee_Power\" title=\"Melee Power\">Melee</a>, <a href=\"/page/Ranged_Power\" title=\"Ranged Power\">Ranged</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Epic_Belt_of_Thoughtful_Rememberance.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Epic_Belt_of_Thoughtful_Rememberance.png/420px-Epic_Belt_of_Thoughtful_Rememberance.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"545\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Epic_Belt_of_Thoughtful_Rememberance.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>This belt is said to protect the wielder from dark energies, and conjure images of a soothing nature.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817204425\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCP